    "perplexity": {
      "description": "Losey is the sixth release on Rocket Recordings from Gnoomes, a Russian-born duo now based in Slovenia, and it continues their blend of electronic propulsion, psychedelic atmosphere, and rock texture. Issued as a limited Slate Grey vinyl edition, the album presents seven tracks that move between motorik drive, kosmische shimmer, acid-tinged rhythm, and hazy, emotionally charged songwriting.\n\nThe record has been described as a deeply personal and forward-looking statement shaped by displacement and relocation, with titles like “Foreign Agent,” “Repeat Repent,” and “Satan’s Ball” hinting at its tense but hopeful mood. Coming after 2023’s Ax Ox, Losey extends Gnoomes’ reputation for fusing stargaze, techno, shoegaze, and krautrock into music that feels both club-informed and expansive, reinforcing their place among Rocket Recordings’ more adventurous artists.",
